description	"Clone Trooper Officer

Soldiers bred for leadership among the ranks of the Republic.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- DC-15s Clone Pistol (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Bunny Hop (0)
- Stamina (0)
- 5% less knockback taken
- Grapple Hop
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Anti MT (1)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4 Weapon Out]"